---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Dumpsters 911"
  description="Read the Terms and Conditions for renting roll-off dumpsters with Dumpsters 911. Flat-rate pricing rules, weight limits, prohibited items & driveway protection terms."
  canonical="https://dumpsters911.com/terms-and-conditions/"
  activePage="terms"
>
  <section class="hero-section" style="padding: 50px 0 35px; text-align: center;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <span class="banner-pill" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Legal & Rental Agreement</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title" style="font-size: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.2;">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 10px;">
        Last Updated: January 1, 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding: 60px 0 90px; background-color: var(--bg-cream);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 3.5px solid #000000; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #000000; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px 35px; color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1rem;">
        
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          1. Acceptance of Terms
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          By scheduling a roll-off dumpster rental, submitting a quote request, or reserving online with Dumpsters 911 ("Company," "we," "us"), a registered trade name of Dumpsters 2 Go LLC, you ("Customer," "you") agree to be bound by the following Terms and Conditions. Please review them carefully prior to booking.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          2. Rental Period & Flat-Rate Pricing
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #475569;">
          Our standard dumpster rentals include delivery, haul-away, flexible rental duration (typically up to 7 days), and a baseline weight allowance depending on the container size:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px; color: #475569;">
          <li><strong>15 Yard Dumpster:</strong> Flat rate starting at $399 (Includes 1.5–2 Tons weight limit).</li>
          <li><strong>20 Yard Dumpster:</strong> Flat rate starting at $450 (Includes 2–2.5 Tons weight limit).</li>
          <li><strong>30 Yard Dumpster:</strong> Flat rate starting at $500 (Includes 3 Tons weight limit).</li>
          <li><strong>40 Yard Dumpster:</strong> Flat rate starting at $599 (Includes 4 Tons weight limit).</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          Rental extensions beyond the agreed timeline are available for an additional daily rate. Contact dispatch at (248) 479-3667 at least 24 hours prior to scheduled pickup if an extension is required.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          3. Driveway Protection & Placement
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          Dumpsters 911 equipment is fitted with driveway-safe rubber wheels to protect concrete and asphalt surfaces under normal placement conditions. Customer warrants that the placement site (driveway, private road, or parking pad) is capable of bearing the weight of the dumpster and haul truck. Customer is responsible for clearing vehicles, low-hanging tree branches, overhead wires, and gate access prior to delivery.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          4. Prohibited Materials & Hazardous Waste
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #475569;">
          Customer agrees NOT to place any of the following prohibited materials inside the dumpster:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px; color: #475569;">
          <li>Hazardous chemicals, toxic waste, oils, gas, or flammable liquids</li>
          <li>Liquid wet paint, lacquers, or chemical solvents</li>
          <li>Car tires, automotive batteries, or sealed gas cylinders</li>
          <li>Asbestos, medical waste, or toxic insulation</li>
          <li>Wet liquid concrete (cured/hardened concrete chunks allowed only in designated heavy containers)</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          Disposal of prohibited hazardous items may incur hazardous handling surcharges or landfill rejection fees charged directly to the customer.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          5. Fill Level & Overweight Restrictions
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          Debris must be loaded evenly and remain flush with or below the top rim of the dumpster. For safety and highway transportation regulations, drivers cannot haul overloaded containers where debris exceeds sidewall height. Any weight exceeding the included tonnage limit will be billed at standard landfill overage rates per additional ton.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          6. Cancellations & Rescheduling
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          Cancellations or delivery date changes must be communicated at least 24 hours before the scheduled dispatch time to avoid a trip fee.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          7. Contact Information
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #475569;">
          For questions regarding your rental agreement, billing, or order adjustments:
        </p>
        <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 2px solid #000000; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; font-weight: 600;">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;"><strong>Dumpsters 911 / Dumpsters 2 Go LLC</strong></p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">Phone: <a href="tel:248-479-3667" style="color: var(--primary-red); font-weight: 800;">(248) 479-3667</a></p>
          <p style="margin: 0;">Metro Detroit & Surrounding Michigan Communities</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
